        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# OpenSim as a 3D Host Candidate\n\nWhether the OpenSim virtual-world server is a workable 3D host for Twilite graphs, what its object model already gives us, and what is still unresearched.\n\nStarted from one pasted fragment of a design conversation, not the full thread. Treat everything about OpenSim itself as unverified until the open questions in the synthesis are answered."
        }
      }
