        "citation": "components/GraphEditor/utils/surfaceChains.js, VIEW_HOSTS",
        "contribution": "Confirms Twilite already reserves a 3d host tag with no implementation behind it.",
        "provenance": "Primary: read directly from the Twilite repository on 2026-09-25.",
